<div class="w-full h-full mx-auto flex flex-col justify-evenly">
    <img src="/logo.svg" alt="{{site_name}} Logo" class="w-full md:w-1/2 mx-auto" />
    <div class="flex flex-col">
        <p class="sr-only">Loading...</p>
        <div class="flex flex-row gap-x-4 h-6 md:h-10 justify-center" title="Loading...">
            <div class="bg-[#3f8bff] rounded-full motion-safe:animate-[bounce_2s_infinite] h-6 w-6 md:h-10 md:w-10">
            </div>
            <div
                class="bg-[#3f8bff] rounded-full motion-safe:animate-[bounce_2s_infinite_200ms] h-6 w-6 md:h-10 md:w-10">
            </div>
            <div
                class="bg-[#3f8bff] rounded-full motion-safe:animate-[bounce_2s_infinite_400ms] h-6 w-6 md:h-10 md:w-10">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto delay-show mt-8 text-center">
            If you don't see anything else happening by now, something probably went wrong. Sorry 🥺👉👈 Try reloading?
            <br>
            Not currently working in Firefox: <a href="https://bugzil.la/1360870">Bug 1360870</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>